<title>FINLAND: KEKKILA SEES IMPROVING PROFITABILITY.</title>
<headline>KEKKILA SEES IMPROVING PROFITABILITY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish fertilisers and saplings maker Kekkila Oy said on Wednesday it expected operating profitability to improve this year and it also saw possibilities for sales to grow.</p>
<p>&quot;By continuing to focus on the areas and products where our competitiveness is good and by improving cost efficiency, we believe that the profitability of our operations will improve,&quot; Kekkila said in a statement with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>&quot;The growth in gardening and construction is expected to enhance the possibilities to increase sales in the current year,&quot; Kekkila said.</p>
</text>
